251	     * Handles {@link DuplicateOwnerHouseholdException} raised when an owner request would
252	     * create an owner whose last name and address (compared case-insensitively with
253	     * collapsed whitespace) already belong to another owner, without opting in to a shared
254	     * household. Returns a 409 Conflict whose {@code errors} array names the {@code lastName}
255	     * and {@code address} fields.
